---
import CinematicSection from "@shared/CinematicSection.astro";
import Container from "@shared/Container.astro";
import SpecularButton from "@shared/SpecularButton.astro";
import { routes } from "@shared/features/routes";

---
<CinematicSection>
<section class="bg-[#0B0B0B]" aria-labelledby="direction-title">
        <Container class="py-16 md:py-24 lg:py-28">
          <div class="grid gap-7 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.9fr)_minmax(24rem,0.72fr)] lg:items-end lg:gap-16">
            <div>
              <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#D8B66B]">
                CURRENT DIRECTION
              </p>
              <h2
                id="direction-title"
                class="mt-4 text-4xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-[-0.04em] text-[#F7F3EA] sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl"
              >
                現在の支援領域
              </h2>
            </div>
            <p class="max-w-xl text-sm leading-8 text-[#CFC8BC] sm:text-base">
              これまでのWEBマーケティングと事業運営の経験を、現在はHPのAI化と企業のAX支援へつなげています。
            </p>
          </div>

          <div
            role="list"
            class="mt-12 border-t border-[rgba(216,182,107,0.32)] md:mt-16"
          >
            <div
              role="listitem"
              class="group relative grid gap-6 border-b border-[rgba(216,182,107,0.24)] py-9 sm:py-11 lg:grid-cols-[5.5rem_minmax(15rem,0.82fr)_minmax(22rem,1.18fr)] lg:items-start lg:gap-10"
            >
              <span class="text-5xl font-bold leading-none tracking-[-0.07em] text-[#D8B66B]/45 transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:text-[#D8B66B] sm:text-6xl">
                01
              </span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-[0.68rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#D8B66B]">
                  AI-READY HOMEPAGE
                </p>
                <h3 class="mt-4 text-2xl font-bold tracking-[-0.035em] text-[#F7F3EA] sm:text-3xl">
                  HPのAI化
                </h3>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="max-w-2xl text-sm leading-8 text-[#CFC8BC] sm:text-base">
                  既存ホームページの制作・保守・更新・改善を、AI活用前提で自社主導に変える支援です。
                </p>
                <div class="mt-7">
                  <SpecularButton href={routes.aiHomepage}>
                    HPのAI化を見る
                  </SpecularButton>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div
              role="listitem"
              class="group relative grid gap-6 border-b border-[rgba(216,182,107,0.24)] py-9 sm:py-11 lg:grid-cols-[5.5rem_minmax(15rem,0.82fr)_minmax(22rem,1.18fr)] lg:items-start lg:gap-10"
            >
              <span class="text-5xl font-bold leading-none tracking-[-0.07em] text-[#D8B66B]/45 transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:text-[#D8B66B] sm:text-6xl">
                02
              </span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-[0.68rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#D8B66B]">
                  AX SUPPORT
                </p>
                <h3 class="mt-4 text-2xl font-bold tracking-[-0.035em] text-[#F7F3EA] sm:text-3xl">
                  AX・業務効率化支援
                </h3>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="max-w-2xl text-sm leading-8 text-[#CFC8BC] sm:text-base">
                  AIを話題やツール導入で終わらせず、企業の業務とマーケティングの実務へ接続します。
                </p>
                <div class="mt-7">
                  <SpecularButton href={routes.axSupport}>
                    AX・業務効率化支援を見る
                  </SpecularButton>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </Container>
      </section>
</CinematicSection>
